H as a loneliness meter: half-turn circular tournaments (S26 extended)

Thesis under test: H is an exact detector of the nondegenerate open-semicircle/1/2-gap state, with the max_gap=1/2 boundary completed by the tie path. Above H=1 it is a circular-tournament class meter, not a scalar max-gap meter.

